// filepath: d:\Capstone\Project\.npmrc
legacy-peer-deps=true
engine-strict=false
```

## Step 4: Create a shell script for deployment on Render

````bash
# filepath: d:\Capstone\Project\deploy.sh
#!/bin/bash

# Set environment variables
export NODE_OPTIONS=--openssl-legacy-provider
export REACT_APP_API_URL=https://plant-disease-detection-yz5v.onrender.com/predict

# Install dependencies
npm install

# Build the React app
npm run build

# Output success message
echo "Build completed successfully!"